      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time, as granted and customer approved. If the validation checks fail during the patch, the rollback procedure is to execute the command orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>, which restores the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. This process is automatic if any validation fails during the patch window [art_fff67d92fe41][art_f893faeda15a].",
