      "answer": "For the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot, the temporary field mappings planned in the router transform are: mapping txn_id to transaction_id, mapping total_amount to amount_cents, applying type coercion (string to int), and preserving key fields such as store_id and register_id. The transform will also add a flag field _ns_transform=true and log each transformed event to OR-AUDIT-LOGS for traceability [art_5a91258f4056][art_6c5bb3a4b89f].\n\nThe March 23 workshop is supposed to produce a signed schema document that defines the canonical schema for payment, register_events, and sensor_thermo topics, along with alias mapping and a producer migration plan. This signed schema will be uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG and accompanied by a change control ticket outlining producer migration milestones [art_5a91258f4056].",
